 "commit": {
  "author": "Azzinoth",
  "date": "2026-11-12T03:25:03Z",
  "message": "FEGBuffer and FESSAO now delete their framebuffers in destructors, previously framebuffers and all G-buffer textures were leaked every time camera rendering data was recreated; FECameraRenderingData now deletes post process effects that were created by renderer, they are stored in EngineProvidedPostProcessEffects, effects added by application are not deleted; FEPostProcess now deletes its stages; FERenderer::InitializeComputeShaderPointCloudRendering now frees initial data of point cloud buffer after it is uploaded to GPU; FEMesh now deletes its index, position, color, normal, tangent, UV and material index buffers in destructor, previously only VAO was deleted; FEResourceManager::AddColorToFEMeshVertices now deletes old color buffer before creating new one; FEMesh::GetTrianglePositions and GetTriangleUVs now free buffers with data that was read from GPU; FEPointCloud now deletes its compute shader buffers in destructor; FEResourceManager::SetUpPointCloudGPUBuffers now deletes and clears additional compute shader buffers before creating new ones; FELineCollection now stores ID of quad buffer in QuadBufferID and deletes quad and line buffers in destructor; FEGLTFLoader::Clear now frees data of loaded buffers, previously whole .bin file was leaked on every import; FEResourceManager::SaveFENativeScriptModule now frees copies of script and project asset packages after they are written to file; LoadTextureFileAsync now deletes its input data as LoadTextureAsyncInfo, previously it was deleted as void*, so file path was leaked; LoadTextureFileAsyncCallBack now frees file data with delete[]; FETerrainSystem::SetHeightMap, SaveTerrainLayerMask, DeleteTerrainLayerMask and LoadTerrainLayerMask now free texture data that was read from GPU; FETerrainSystem::LoadTerrainLayerMask now deletes texture that was loaded from mask file; Cached data of terrain layer maps is now freed with delete[] and is freed when terrain component is destroyed; FETerrainSystem::DuplicateTerrainComponent no longer copies pointers to cached data of layer maps, previously copy and original were sharing the same buffers.",
  "url": "https://github.com/Azzinoth/FocalEngine/commit/cefcbb696dce62bdb60dd4e8f5cc696333b6eae4"
 },
